              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.3.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amosi 3:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha yuya malaika ambaye kala akaima chigulu chimwenga baharini na chanjina tsi kavu achigolosa mkpwonowe wa kulume dzulu mlunguni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Waapa kpwa dzina ra Mlungu aishiye hata kare na kare na ambaye waumba dzulu mlunguni, duniani, baharini na viumbe vyosi virivyo ndani yao. Achiamba, “Wakati wa kugodzera ukasira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela hiye malaika wa sabaa ndiphopiga gundare, Mlungu andakamilisha mpangowe wa siri sawa na viratu arivyoatangazira atumishie, ambao ni manabii.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
